     "en": "The provision of additional benefits for war invalids in Bình Thuận is marked by \"one getting all, another left in the cold\" or \"some get more than they can eat, others get nothing\" during the implementation of government decree nr. 131/2021/NĐ-CP, dated December 30, 2021."
